Perch
A fork of Dock (https://github.com/Mobinshahidi/Dock), Copyright the Dock
authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes in this fork: swipeable Widgets / Photos / Clock pages, Digital,
Analog and Float clock faces replacing the original clock styles, and a
light-sensor-driven red Night Mode replacing the scheduled night dim.

Bundled font: Nunito (https://github.com/googlefonts/nunito), licensed under
the SIL Open Font License 1.1 — see licenses/OFL-Nunito.txt.

Settings icons: Material Icons (https://github.com/google/material-design-icons),
Copyright Google LLC, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Upstream's LICENSE file is kept unchanged. Its wording differs in places from
the canonical Apache License 2.0; it names that license and points to
http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0, which is the text this fork relies on.
